{"id":"w62682","name":"Oatmeal Cookies I","author":"Wikibooks Cookbook contributors","source":{"name":"Wikibooks Cookbook","url":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Cookbook:Oatmeal_Cookies_I"},"via":{"name":"Wikibooks","url":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Cookbook:Oatmeal_Cookies_I"},"image":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Oatmeal%20cookies%20on%20a%20plate.jpg?width=640","cuisine":"","country":"","region":"Global","course":"dessert","protein":"veggie","diet":2,"allergens":8197,"minutes":25,"time":{"prep":10,"cook":15,"passive":0,"passiveWhy":[]},"timeEstimated":false,"servings":"20","difficulty":"easy","ingredients":[{"item":"¾ cup (180 g) shortening","qty":""},{"item":"1 cup (240 g) brown sugar","qty":""},{"item":"½ cup (120 g) white sugar","qty":""},{"item":"1 egg","qty":""},{"item":"¼ cup (60 ml) water","qty":""},{"item":"1 tsp vanilla","qty":""},{"item":"3 cups (700 g) rolled oats","qty":""},{"item":"1 cup (240 g) all-purpose flour","qty":""},{"item":"½ tsp baking soda","qty":""},{"item":"¼ tsp salt","qty":""},{"item":"1 cup raisins (optional)","qty":""}],"steps":["Using a mixer, cream together the shortening, brown sugar, white sugar, egg, water and vanilla until light and fluffy (about 10 minutes on high).","In a mixing bowl, mix together the oats, flour, baking soda, and salt.","Add dry ingredients into wet, mix well using mixer.","Stir in raisins if using.","Scoop the portions out—this recipe makes 20 cookies, so make 20 portions.","Bake at 350°F (180°C) for 8–10 minutes."],"tags":[],"youtube":"","culture":null,"license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","lifestyle":3,"era":"modern"}